	(15696,18414,1,'You did it! We\'re saved!','You did it! We\'re saved!',0,0,4,0,0,0,0,1,'Are we really finally going to Azshara? Is there a volcano there, too?','Are we really finally going to Azshara? Is there a volcano there, too?',0,0,6,0,0,0,0,1,'How can I ever thank you, $N?','How can I ever thank you, $N?',0,0,6,0,0,0,0,1,'I\'d keep my eyes and ears open if I were you. There\'s a rumor going around that you caused both Mount Kajaro and the Lost Isles volcanoes to explode.$B$BCrazy, I know. But people will gossip about anything and love to tear down their heroes, especially if there\'s a chance for profit and promotion.','I\'d keep my eyes and ears open if I were you. There\'s a rumor going around that you caused both Mount Kajaro and the Lost Isles volcanoes to explode.$B$BCrazy, I know. But people will gossip about anything and love to tear down their heroes, especially if there\'s a chance for profit and promotion.',0,0,25,0,0,0,0,1,'Let\'s leave dock before the volcano destroys us all!','Let\'s leave dock before the volcano destroys us all!',0,0,5,0,0,0,0,1,'Ready to go when you are, $g sir : ma\'am;!','Ready to go when you are, $g sir : ma\'am;!',0,0,66,0,0,0,0,1,'I don\'t know. I think I\'m going to miss this place. We had some pretty good times here.','I don\'t know. I think I\'m going to miss this place. We had some pretty good times here.',0,0,6,0,0,0,0,1,'I have an idea... this time let\'s not wander through a naval battle between the Alliance and the Horde.$B$BI\'m just saying.','I have an idea... this time let\'s not wander through a naval battle between the Alliance and the Horde.$B$BI\'m just saying.',0,0,1,0,0,0,0),
