	(14368,18414,1,'These babies can hurl fire like none other. We\'ve even attached a secondary cannon, a grappling hook and added a manual fuel injection system.  If you can obtain liquid pyrite from the mechanognomes, you can use it to hurl high-density explosives, or turbo-boost your movement speed. 

Let\'s see those Explorers\' League twirps beat that!','These babies can hurl fire like none other. We\'ve even attached a secondary cannon, a grappling hook and added a manual fuel injection system.  If you can obtain liquid pyrite from the mechanognomes, you can use it to hurl high-density explosives, or turbo-boost your movement speed. 

