	(17131,18414,1,'Alchemy allows you to use herbs and other materials to create a wide variety of useful elixirs, potions, oils, flasks and cauldrons. You\'ll also gain greater, longer-lasting benefits when using your own elixirs and flasks.

Highly skilled alchemists may also transmute elemental materials and certain minerals for use by other production professions.

Alchemy pairs well with Herbalism as it allows you to gather your own herbs.','Alchemy allows you to use herbs and other materials to create a wide variety of useful elixirs, potions, oils, flasks and cauldrons. You\'ll also gain greater, longer-lasting benefits when using your own elixirs and flasks.

