	(6844,21742,1,'Their manifest forms weak from eons of battle, imprisoned beneath the world - the world that they themselves created - the corruption of the Titan Shapers would permeate through the surface and befoul the Old Gods.$B$BIt was then and there that the brothers did turn. For five millennia a battle was fought at the core of this world.
