	(26967,45745,1,'The differences that have set the Arakkoa apart for years seem so trivial today. We have squandered the might of our people on fear and mistrust of one another when we should have been looking beyond the safety of Skyreach. There is nothing to be done about the past, but know that there are some who wish for our people to be more than a footnote to what Gul\'dan has wrought.

