	(33795,45745,1,'With Alleria\'s teaching, we can avoid the fate suffered by those on Eredath.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'Although broken and scattered, this rift holds many secrets. It will teach us much about the nature of the shadows.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'Locus-Walker is an intriguing fellow.

