	(42252,45745,1,'Hoo! Hello! New aspirant! Yay!','Hoo! Hello! New aspirant! Yay!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'Hi! You new! Very good! Yes!','Hi! You new! Very good! Yes!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'AHH! New aspirant! Ring bells! Sound horns! Best day!!!','AHH! New aspirant! Ring bells! Sound horns! Best day!!!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'Make clean. Make nice. Bastion beautiful, yes?','Make clean. Make nice. Bastion beautiful, yes?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'You want, I get?','You want, I get?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'<The steward hums a jolly tune to himself.>','<The steward hums a jolly tune to herself.>',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'We help! What do you need?','We help! What do you need?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'I get you something?','I get you something?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
	(42253,45745,1,'You want, I get?','You want, I get?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'<The steward hums a jolly tune to himself.>','<The steward hums a jolly tune to herself.>',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'We help! What do you need?','We help! What do you need?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'I get you something?','I get you something?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'How can this one make happy?','How can this one make happy?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'Nice aspirant. What need?','Nice aspirant. What need?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'Good training today? Sore? Maybe sit. Maybe stretch.','Good training today? Sore? Maybe sit. Maybe stretch.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'Juice is good for thinking. Good for sparring. You want I get juice?','Juice is good for thinking. Good for sparring. You want I get juice?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
	(42255,45745,1,'How are you passing the time, friend?','How are you passing the time, friend?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'Though Bastion is a shadow of its former glory, it is still the most beautiful place I have ever been. If I had to pick a place to wait for eternity, this would be it.','Though Bastion is a shadow of its former glory, it is still the most beautiful place I have ever been. If I had to pick a place to wait for eternity, this would be it.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'There is nothing to be done. No amount of meditation or training will bring me closer to ascension. Not right now, anyway.

<He sighs deeply.>','There is nothing to be done. No amount of meditation or training will bring me closer to ascension. Not right now, anyway.

<She sighs deeply.>',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'Where did your training leave off? I was on the precipice of completing the Rite of Loyalty when things began to unravel. I was so close to ascension... so close.','Where did your training leave off? I was on the precipice of completing the Rite of Loyalty when things began to unravel. I was so close to ascension... so close.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'I just want to start the Five Rites.','I just want to start the Five Rites.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'How long has it been since things were normal? Time passes so strangely here.','How long has it been since things were normal? Time passes so strangely here.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'I have so much to learn, and this delay is only prolonging that journey. I fear I will never ascend.','I have so much to learn, and this delay is only prolonging that journey. I fear I will never ascend.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,'How long have YOU been waiting?','How long have YOU been waiting?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
