	(43021,45745,0,'Ah, welcome friend, did you know that the passage to Tazavesh is open once again?

Tread lightly there, they are not so friendly to outsiders. They do have many things to trade, though. 

Valuable things, glittering things.

I have acquired some of their goods. Have you ever seen a baubleworm? They grow gems from their hides that glow with an inner light, but fade and crack when the creature dies. 

Very rare, very valuable.

