Look for his stall at the fountain on the lower level of Tradewinds Market, just down the stairs from the inn.','Don\'t get me started on the gold I\'ve spent on repairs. Thankfully, the admiralty has its own blacksmith to take care of our issued gear. But, for your personal stuff, I highly recommend you go see Patrick Markson. Yes, I know he sells firearms. But, he\'s also great at fixing just about anything.

