	(28106,55664,1,'$n, I believe there is something very powerful in this cave. But, because of the immense fel energy that permeates Mardum, I cannot be certain. My vision is clouded.

If there is something in there, we can\'t afford to ignore it. Your mastery of spectral sight is greater than any, save Lord Illidan.

