	(34661,55664,1,'I have fewer days ahead now than behind.

I\'ll not spend them watching Kul Tiras fall apart.','',0,0,1,0,0,0,0,1,'When Daelin asked me to leave his guard and raise this child of the Eastern Kingdoms, I struggled to understand why. 

