	(14681,65299,1,'','Hi, babe! How do I look?',0,0,4,0,0,0,0,1,'','I missed you so much! Where have you been?$B$BAre you going to answer me, or just stand there?',0,0,6,0,0,0,0,1,'','Do you like my outfit?  It\'s for the party. I charged it to your account.

Yeah, the contract gave me access to your finances, by the way.',0,0,6,0,0,0,0,1,'','There was another goblin just hitting on me. Oh, the nerve!$B$BWill you beat them up for me, sweetie? Thanks. Love ya!',0,0,5,0,0,0,0,1,'','I can\'t wait for the day when you rise to the top. Just think, I\'ll be able to call myself Mrs. Trade $g Prince : Princess;.$B$BNot to mention buy all that stuff I\'ve always wanted!!!',0,0,1,0,0,0,0,1,'','Be careful out there. I heard that there are Southsea pirates in the bay.$B$BHmm, maybe I should go check for myself...',0,0,1,0,0,0,0,1,'','Can we go on a nice, romantic picnic on top of Mount Kajaro?$B$BMake sure you pickup my favorite champagne!',0,0,6,0,0,0,0,1,'','You\'ve got a mischievous look in your eye. What have you been up to, babe?$B$BWell?',0,0,6,0,0,0,0),
