	(570020,65299,1,'Let me tell you, friend, the city\'s ferry system is one of the true wonders of the world. Not only can it take you from place to place inside the wondrous waterways of Boralus proper, the ferry masters also serve the outskirts into the rest of Tiragarde Sound.

If you\'re looking for a pleasant boat ride, look no further than Will Melbourne. You can find him and his daughter, Sally down at water level on the south side of Tradewinds Market.','Let me tell you, friend, the city\'s ferry system is one of the true wonders of the world. Not only can it take you from place to place inside the wondrous waterways of Boralus proper, the ferry masters also serve the outskirts into the rest of Tiragarde Sound.

