	(600098,65299,1,'','Hey sweetie! We\'re so happy to welcome you enjoy the thrills of playing at the Gallagio! ... or that\'s what I would say, if there wasn\'t a revolution goin\' on.

The Boss is paranoid, hidin\' somewhere inside and kicked a lot of us out to make room for his hired muscle. I\'m not sure what all the fuss is about, but I\'m more than happy to see to your every need. Even if you end up wrecking the place, the Gallagio treasures your loyalty.

