But when Cho speaks, you\'ll know what it felt like to live through those times. I hear Li Li Stormstout started her apprenticeship with him and is showing a lot of promise!

Currently she is in Stormwind, near Olivia\'s pond, if you don\'t believe me.','Lorewalker Cho tells so many excellent stories.

Most Lorewalkers can tell the facts of a story, what happened in the past.

