She\'s here to show us a better way.',0,0,1,0,0,0,0,1,'The end is coming. It\'s always approaching. What will you do when it finally arrives?','The end is coming. It\'s always approaching. What will you do when it finally arrives?',0,0,1,0,0,0,0,1,'There\'s always another struggle on Azeroth. What if you could leave it all behind?

