Know anything about the Radiant Song? It just never ends.',0,0,1,0,0,0,0,1,'Hello. I\'m conducting market research. On a scale of one to ten, how likely are you to surrender to that unsettling voice in your head?','Hello. I\'m conducting market research. On a scale of one to ten, how likely are you to surrender to that unsettling voice in your head?',0,0,1,0,0,0,0,1,'Are you interested in a gathering of select, elite individuals dedicated to studying matters most would shy away from?

